<p>You breathe lightning in a frontal cone of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9.</acronym> Any target caught in the area will take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Strength 100">67, 86, 101, 113, 124</acronym> to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Strength 100">201, 259, 303, 339, 371</acronym> lightning damage (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Strength 100">134, 173, 202, 226, 247</acronym> average) and be stunned for 3 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Strength, and the critical chance is based on your Mental crit rate, and the Stun apply power is based on your Mindpower.</p><p>Each point in storm drake talents also increases your lightning resistance by 1%.</p>